### zerobas loads MV.BAS (SAVEd by the CF-3300 with TXTTAB at $C001)
   |  10 PRINT "AAAA"
   |  20 PRINT "BB":GOTO 30
   |  30 PRINT "END"
   |  ZB
   |  RUN
   |  AAAA
   |  BB
   |  END
   |  ZB
   |  color  auto   goto   list   run
### zerobas loads MV2.BAS (SAVEd by the CF-3300 with TXTTAB at $C001)
== S3 ('35:')  pc=01CC curlin=FFFF mode=S0
   |  10 A%=256:B%=&H100:PRINT A%;B%
   |  20 PRINT "TWO"
   |  ZB
   |  RUN
   |   256  256
   |  TWO
   |  ZB
   |  color  auto   goto   list   run
